{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56576","headline":"九转诗 四 · 窦真君","name":"九转诗 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白锡虽初化，黄芽制已凝。\n元如天降雪，映似结池水。\n研土乾和炒，罗灰湿拌蒸。\n仍须看炁色，更待卤咸澄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦真君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}